info superchute book~
At the time of creation, all 100 rooms were used(0-99) for this zone.
Everything loads into room 01.  Room 01 has doors in every direction.
Currently only 02,03 and part of 04 rooms are used for distribution.
The rest of 04, all of 05, 06, and 07 can be used later by simply 
editing the zon file to not close the doors from room 01 to those rooms.
The unused portions are ready to be used anytime for any sort of mob
distribution.  The Zon file closes the doors to the unused parts of
the chute.

Once a mob wanders out of the 02-07 rooms, any NSWE takes it to a zone.
Up, down connects all the rooms of the lowest teir.

5 mobs load every 5 ticks, each with a potion.  only 50 mobs are
allowed, but 100 potions are allowed, so that potions will still load
on mobs even if a few players have a few potions on themselves.
~
